            "notes": "(*\ud83d\udfe9= buy,\ud83d\udfe5= sell,\ud83d\udfe7= sell if if you can't afford all\ud83d\udfe9items,\u2b1c= keep*)\n\n## \u2328\ufe0f GAMEPLAY ##\n\nSame as Round 1, but [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) providing lingering [Crossfade](ability_3ea2d5de-0836-4fef-b232-e70f961c99da) gives you more wiggle room for dives. [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) increases general survivability. You could take [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) instead of [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if you stomped Round 1 and don't think you need the survivability. \n\n## \ud83c\udfaf TARGET ITEMS ##\n\n- \ud83d\udfe9[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97)\n- \ud83d\udfe9[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n- \u2b1c[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 RECCOMENDED EXTRAS ##\n\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n- [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)",
