            "notes": "(*\ud83d\udfe9= buy,\ud83d\udfe5= sell,\ud83d\udfe7= sell if if you can't afford all\ud83d\udfe9/\u2b1citems,\u2b1c= keep*)\n\n## \u2328\ufe0f GAMEPLAY ##\n\nOne final time, although this time a lot faster, make your dives and keep up the funds for BigHealing Corp. [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) is strong as you are near guaranteed -15/20% [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) for [Amp It Up](ability_ea72cca9-6348-4221-946c-a5d2c1714a42) which let's you trigger [Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) over and over by cycling [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512) into your attack pattern. Most tanks with big hit boxes like [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) melt pretty quickly in Round 7. Take [Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575) if you want I find it to be a lot of fun but it's definitely not 'optimal'.\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf TARGET ITEMS ##\n- \ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe7[Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4)\n- \u2b1c[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)\n- \u2b1c[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)\n- \u2b1c[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)\n- \u2b1c[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n- \u2b1c[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97)\n- \ud83d\udfe5[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 RECCOMENDED EXTRAS ##\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce)\n- [Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575)\n\nIf you have tons of cash left over after buying [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) (or whatever your choice of 5th purple was), sell [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) and buy [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce).",
